  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\r\n\r\nIt may not be possible to deprecate the `canPlayType()` API, but maybe we can encourage user agents to display a warning and also discourage further specify these capabilities for media elements and instead use [w3c.github.io/media-capabilities/](https://w3c.github.io/media-capabilities/). ",
